	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Replaces ~/dotfiles/bin/butler's file/project/documents/directory/caffeinate cases with native Alfred Script Filters. Keywords: file (~/Downloads files), proj (~/src and ~/opt dirs, maxdepth 3), doc (~/Documents files), dir (~/Documents and ~/Downloads dirs, maxdepth 3) -- each copies the selected path to the clipboard. caff toggles ~/dotfiles/bin/toggle-caffeinate. The butler clipboard and password/username cases are intentionally not reimplemented here; see NOTES.md.</string>
